-- =========================================================
-- CURSOR ATTRIBUTES
-- =========================================================

/*

IMPLICIT CURSOR ATTRIBUTES

SQL%FOUND
    TRUE if rows were affected.

SQL%NOTFOUND
    TRUE if no rows were affected.

SQL%ROWCOUNT
    Returns the number of rows affected.

SQL%ISOPEN
    Always FALSE for implicit cursors.


EXPLICIT CURSOR ATTRIBUTES

EMP_CURSOR%FOUND
    TRUE if the last FETCH returned a row.

EMP_CURSOR%NOTFOUND
    TRUE if the last FETCH did not return a row.

EMP_CURSOR%ROWCOUNT
    Number of rows fetched so far.

EMP_CURSOR%ISOPEN
    TRUE if the cursor is currently open.

*/
